    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm reviewing a claim for a warehouse fire in Rotterdam. Can you give me a breakdown of the primary risk factors associated with storing high volumes of flammable industrial solvents in high-density racking systems? specifically looking at things like thermal runaway and ventilation issues.",
