    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. regarding the ignition risks, sometimes these things seem to happen unexpectedly even when everything looks fine according to the log. what are the most common \"hidden\" or unpredictable factors that lead to a sudden ignition in these kinds of setups?",
